{{wikipedia|Allahu Akbar}}
[[Image:FlagofWaziristan.png|thumb|{{Arab|[[الله أكبر]]}}]]
==English==

===Alternative spellings===
* [[Allah akbar]]

===Etymology===
From Arabic {{Arab|[[الله]]}} ([[Allah]]/[[God]]) and {{Arab|[[أكبر]]}} (’ákbar, [[greater]]/[[greatest]]), the [[elative]] ({{compar}}/{{superl}}) of {{Arab|[[كبير]]}} (kabīr, [[big]]).

===Phrase===
'''[[Allah]]u [[akbar]]'''

# {{Islam}} The [[Muslim]] [[takbir]] ([[proclamation]]) "[[God]] is most [[great]]."

